# UI Design Rules — Dark Premium To-Do App
Stack: Next.js + Tailwind CSS  
Theme: Calm, dark, layered cards

---

# 1. Design Principles

- Dark navy background (NOT pure black)
- Cards are primary interaction surface
- No harsh borders
- Subtle shadows for depth
- 8px spacing system
- Smooth 150–250ms transitions
- Only one dominant CTA per screen

---

# 2. Tailwind Theme Extension (tailwind.config.js)

```js
theme: {
  extend: {
    colors: {
      app: {
        bg: '#0B1120',        // main background (deep navy)
        surface: '#0F172A',   // sidebar / elevated surfaces
        card: '#111827',      // card background
        muted: '#94A3B8',     // secondary text
        accent: '#3B82F6',    // primary action blue
        success: '#22C55E',
        danger: '#EF4444'
      }
    },
    boxShadow: {
      card: '0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)',
      hover: '0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)'
    },
    borderRadius: {
      xl2: '18px'
    }
  }
}
```

---

# 3. Layout Rules

## Desktop Layout
```
| Sidebar (260px fixed) | Main Content (flex-1) |
```

### Sidebar
- `w-[260px]`
- `bg-app-surface`
- `border-r border-white/5`
- Active nav item:
  - `bg-app-accent/10`
  - `border-l-4 border-app-accent`

### Main Content
- `flex-1`
- `p-8`
- Max width wrapper: `max-w-7xl mx-auto`

---

# 4. Typography Rules

| Element        | Classes |
|---------------|----------|
| Page Title     | `text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-100` |
| Section Title  | `text-lg font-medium text-slate-200` |
| Card Title     | `text-base font-medium text-slate-100` |
| Body Text      | `text-sm text-slate-300` |
| Meta Text      | `text-xs text-app-muted` |

Font suggestion:
```
font-sans (Inter / Geist / SF Pro style)
```

Line height:
```
leading-relaxed
```

---

# 5. Card Component Rules

## Base Card
```html
<div class="bg-app-card rounded-xl2 p-5 shadow-card border border-white/5 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-hover hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/10">
</div>
```

### Card Structure
```
Title
Description
Meta row (date / tag)
Action icons (right aligned)
```

### Spacing
- Internal padding: `p-5`
- Gap between cards: `gap-6`
- Grid layout:
  - Desktop: `grid grid-cols-3 gap-6`
  - Tablet: `md:grid-cols-2`
  - Mobile: `grid-cols-1`

---

# 6. Search Input Rules

```html
<input
  class="w-full bg-slate-900/60 border border-white/5 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200 placeholder:text-app-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-app-accent/40"
/>
```

Rules:
- Rounded corners
- No bright borders
- Blue glow on focus
- Placeholder muted

---

# 7. Buttons

## Primary Button
```html
<button class="bg-app-accent text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium shadow-md hover:opacity-90 active:scale-95 transition">
</button>
```

## Ghost Button
```html
<button class="text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition">
</button>
```

---

# 8. Floating Action Button (Mobile)

```html
<button class="fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-app-accent shadow-hover flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl transition active:scale-95">
  +
</button>
```

Rules:
- Always centered bottom
- Stronger shadow than cards
- Only visible on mobile

---

# 9. State Rules

## Completed Task
- Reduce opacity slightly: `opacity-70`
- Add success indicator: `text-app-success`
- Checkbox filled

## Favorited
- Icon filled
- `text-app-accent`

## Hover Behavior
- Lift: `hover:-translate-y-0.5`
- Shadow increase
- Slight border highlight

---

# 10. Spacing System

Use 8px base grid.

| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| xs | 4px |
| sm | 8px |
| md | 16px |
| lg | 24px |
| xl | 32px |

Tailwind equivalents:
```
p-1  p-2  p-4  p-6  p-8
gap-2 gap-4 gap-6 gap-8
```

No random spacing values.

---

# 11. Motion Rules

- Transition duration: `duration-200`
- Easing: default ease-in-out
- Hover: subtle
- Modals: fade + scale (opacity + scale 0.98 → 1)

---

# 12. What To Avoid

- Pure black background
- Bright white text (#ffffff)
- Hard borders everywhere
- Large drop shadows
- Multiple primary CTAs on one screen
- Too many visible icons

---

End of Design Rules
